          hints: ['Term by term: product rule on the first, chain rule on the second.', String.raw`$(x\arcsin x)' = \arcsin x + \frac{x}{\sqrt{1 - x^2}}$.`, String.raw`$(\sqrt{1 - x^2})' = \frac{-2x}{2\sqrt{1 - x^2}} = -\frac{x}{\sqrt{1 - x^2}}$.`],
